---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';

const CLAIMS_EMAIL = 'myfriendroze@gmail.com';
---

<Layout
  title="The Small Print | myfriendroze"
  description="Shipping, returns, and damage-claim policy for myfriendroze ceramics."
>
  <Header slot="header" currentPath="/small-print" />

  <section class="page-hero section-padding">
    <div class="page-width">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">the small print</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="small-print section-padding">
    <div class="page-width small-print__wrapper">
      <p>
        Providing you with beautiful, handmade ceramics is the ultimate goal, and I want you to be
        absolutely ecstatic when you open your package. I actually enjoy talking to humans as much
        as clay—even if there's a problem with your order, so please reach out. I will do my
        absolute best to help you, within the bounds of human capability and the laws of physics
        (though I went to art school, so my grasp on physics is highly debatable).
      </p>

      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <p>I pack and ship your ceramics as fast as humanly possible.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Processing Time:</strong> 2–7 business days (it rarely takes the full 7, unless
          the universe throws a tantrum).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Shipping Days:</strong> I aim to ship orders out on Mondays and Tuesdays. However,
          package drops can and probably will bleed into any other day of the week if my schedule
          spirals out of control.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Returns &amp; Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Because these are, fragile, handmade ceramics, I am unable to accept returns. Sending a
        ceramic piece on a two-way round trip with the postal service is just asking for a box of
        powder.
      </p>

      <h3>Damages &amp; Transit Issues</h3>
      <p>
        I pack every order as I'd like something I've ordered to be packed - with an almost absurd
        amount of care. Unfortunately, I cannot control USPS (no matter how hard I manifest it). If
        the postal workers decided to play an aggressive game of basketball with your box and your
        piece arrives broken, here is the game plan:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Take a picture of the broken piece inside its original packaging.</li>
        <li>Email me the horror photos immediately at <a href={`mailto:${CLAIMS_EMAIL}`}>{CLAIMS_EMAIL}</a>.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>The Reality Check:</strong> Everything at myfriendroze is one-of-a-kind. If we
          file a claim and I replace your broken item instead of refunding it, the replacement will
          be similar, but not an exact clone. Think of it as a sibling, but not a twin.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        Once the shipping claim is officially filed, we will jump right into the next steps to get
        your refund issued or your unique replacement piece started.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 0.1rem solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.08);
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .small-print {
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .small-print__wrapper {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .small-print__wrapper h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: calc(2.2rem * var(--font-body-scale));
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
  }

  .small-print__wrapper h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: calc(1.8rem * var(--font-body-scale));
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
  }

  .small-print__wrapper p,
  .small-print__wrapper li {
    font-size: calc(1.5rem * var(--font-body-scale));
  }

  .small-print__wrapper ul,
  .small-print__wrapper ol {
    padding-left: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .small-print__wrapper a {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .small-print__wrapper a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .section-padding {
    padding: var(--spacing-sections) 0;
  }

  .page-width {
    max-width: var(--page-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .page-width {
      padding: 0 4rem;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .page-width {
      padding: 0 5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
